  "description": "3D model format importers for LibreMetaverse. Loads Collada (.dae), glTF 2.0 (.gltf, .glb) and Wavefront OBJ (.obj) models into the ModelPrim structures used for Second Life mesh upload, behind a common IModelLoader interface. Also exports decoded meshes, including rigged ones, as glTF.",
